ns to \"substring of a single observation's output\", and a donor fact minted by an older build is ineligible with the same cheap remedy — look again.","why":"C4 was revised after k1 qualified it: the \"stores the file's bytes verbatim — no line numbers, no headers, no reflowing\" sentence overstated the --lines mode, which re-joins lines with \\n. The paragraph now carries both modes and the reason the relation is unaffected, matching the revised claim.","cite":null,"timestamp":1786174635}
